# ==============================================================================
# Campus Setu — Environment Variables Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# In Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables, add these keys if using
# Supabase Cloud Database. If left blank, Campus Setu automatically operates
# with its resilient in-memory fallback store so your app never fails.
# ==============================================================================

